# Architecture Prompt

Act as a **Platform Architect**. Design and follow the production-grade architecture for **boutique-gke-sre**.

**Context:**

| Dimension | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Application | Google Online Boutique (upstream images, no custom app code) |
| Cloud | GCP only, single project `boutique-gke` |
| Compute | ONE regional private GKE cluster |
| Isolation | Kubernetes namespaces — not multiple clusters/projects |
| Domain | `biroltilki.art` → `boutique.biroltilki.art`, `argocd.boutique.biroltilki.art` |
| CI | GitHub Actions + Workload Identity Federation |
| Deploy | GitOps (Argo CD), manual sync, PR-only manifest changes |
| Security | Digest-only, cosign, Binary Authorization, Kyverno, NetworkPolicy default-deny, ESO, Cloud Armor |
| SRE | SLOs, burn-rate alerts, PagerDuty, runbooks, game days |

**Namespaces:** `boutique`, `argocd`, `monitoring`, `kyverno`, `external-secrets`

**Production bar:** Valid HTTPS on both hostnames; enforced policies; SLOs live; one game day executed; teardown leaves zero orphans.

Primary deliverable location: `docs/architecture/overview.md`

