## 2. Constraints

- **Single GCP project** (`boutique-gke`) — no dev/stage/prod project split
- **Single regional GKE cluster** — environment isolation via namespaces only
- **GCP-only** — no multi-cloud abstraction layer
- **No service mesh** as default (no Istio/Linkerd in baseline)
- **No custom app code** — upstream Online Boutique images only
- **Manual Argo CD sync** — even on single cluster, sync is deliberate
- **WIF-only CI auth** — no long-lived GCP SA keys in GitHub
- **User executes provisioning** — architecture docs guide; user applies

