## 7. Deployment Flow

```
1. Developer merges app/config change OR CI triggered on main
2. GitHub Actions: authenticate via WIF (OIDC → GCP SA)
3. Build or mirror image → Trivy scan (fail on critical/high)
4. Push to Artifact Registry with immutable digest
5. cosign sign image + attach SLSA/provenance attestation
6. CI opens PR (or updates branch) with new digest in Helm values
7. Human review + merge PR (manifest change only in Git)
8. Argo CD detects drift → operator manually syncs Application
9. Binary Authorization evaluates attestations at admission
10. Kyverno validates digest, probes, resources, labels
11. Pods roll out; readiness probes pass
12. Smoke test: curl https://boutique.biroltilki.art (CI or manual)
```

**Rollback:** Revert digest in Git → manual Argo sync → previous ReplicaSet restored.

