## 10. Failure Scenarios

| Scenario | Impact | Detection | Mitigation |
|----------|--------|-----------|------------|
| **Zone loss** | Reduced capacity in one zone | Node NotReady alerts; pod disruption | Regional cluster spreads nodes; PDBs; HPA; Cluster Autoscaler replaces nodes |
| **Bad deploy** (bad digest/config) | Errors, failed rollouts | Argo CD sync degraded; error-rate SLO burn | Manual rollback via Git revert + Argo sync; runbook `bad-deploy-rollback.md` |
| **Redis / cart down** | Cart/checkout failures | cartservice health; checkout SLO burn | Restart StatefulSet; restore from Velero/GKE Backup; game-day validated path |
| **Ingress / TLS failure** | Total external outage | Uptime check on `boutique.biroltilki.art` | Check cert status, Ingress events, static IP binding |
| **Kyverno / ESO down** | New deploys blocked or secrets stale | Platform health alerts | PDB for platform components; priority sync in Argo |
| **Monitoring pipeline failure** | Blind spots (apps may still run) | Missing metric heartbeat alert | OTel collector HPA; fallback Cloud Logging metrics; runbook for observability outage |
| **Binary Auth misconfig** | All deploys blocked | Admission failures in events | Break-glass attestor policy doc; fix IAM/attestor in Terraform |
| **WIF / CI auth failure** | No new images promoted | GitHub Actions failure | Validate pool/provider bindings; no key fallback |

