## 11. Scalability

| Mechanism | Application |
|-----------|-------------|
| **HPA** | frontend, checkout, cart — CPU/request-based scaling |
| **Cluster Autoscaler** | Node pool scales when pending pods unschedulable |
| **Regional cluster** | Control plane HA; nodes across 3 zones |
| **PDBs** | minAvailable on critical services during disruptions |
| **Resource requests/limits** | Required by Kyverno; prevents noisy neighbor |
| **Load balancer** | GCE LB handles L7 scaling for ingress |

**Limits of single-cluster design:** No independent blast-radius isolation between "envs"; namespace quotas cap resource consumption. Sufficient for portfolio/reference traffic.

