## 12. Disaster Recovery

| Asset | RPO Target | RTO Target | Method |
|-------|------------|------------|--------|
| **Redis (cart state)** | < 1h | < 30m | GKE Backup or Velero scheduled backup; restore runbook |
| **Git state** | 0 (source of truth) | minutes | GitHub; Argo resync |
| **Terraform state** | 0 | hours | GCS versioned backend |
| **Secrets** | 0 | minutes | Secret Manager versioning; ESO resync |
| **Cluster** | N/A | hours | Terraform re-apply + Argo bootstrap runbook |

**DR runbooks:** `docs/sre/runbooks/redis-restore.md`, `docs/sre/runbooks/cluster-rebuild.md`

